@Habits.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5023
@habitId = replace-with-id-from-create-response
@date = 2026-10-26

### List active habits
GET {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Accept: application/json

### Create a completion habit
POST {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Stretch",
  "description": "Stretch for five minutes",
  "trackingType": "completion",
  "targetValue": null,
  "unit": null
}

### Get one active habit
GET {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Accept: application/json

### Edit the habit (PUT replaces all editable fields)
PUT {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Morning stretch",
  "description": "Stretch for ten minutes",
  "trackingType": "completion",
  "targetValue": null,
  "unit": null
}

### Archive the habit (soft delete)
DELETE {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}

### Archived habits no longer appear in the active list
GET {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits
Accept: application/json

### Get habits and their saved progress for a date
GET {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/progress?date={{date}}
Accept: application/json

### Mark a completion habit done on that date
POST {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/habits/{{habitId}}/progress
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "{{date}}",
  "trackingType": "completion",
  "completed": true
}

### Read the calendar completion totals for a date range
GET {{Habits.Api_HostAddress}}/api/calendar/summary?startDate={{date}}&endDate={{date}}
Accept: application/json
